    "THIS IS A PROJECT LIST. IT IS NOT THE ASD-STE100 DICTIONARY. The official dictionary was not available.",
    "source = policy: the vocabulary policy of the project owner.",
    "source = ste: a replacement that the author of the list knows from general knowledge of Simplified Technical English. No person compared it with the official dictionary.",
    "source = project: a decision of this project, with no knowledge of the dictionary entry.",
    "pos = v: only the verb is not approved. The noun is in approved-words.txt or is a technical name. The tool finds the forms with -ed and -ing, and it finds the other verb forms from the words near them.",
    "kind = other: the word has no other forms. kind = n: the tool adds the plural. No kind: the tool adds the forms with -s, -ed and -ing. forms: a list of the other forms replaces the forms that the tool makes.",
    "phrases: groups of words. spelling: spelling that is not American, with the American spelling."
